        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Popular Unitary Action Movement, Popular Unity coalition, Chilean Army\n- People: Salvador Allende, Augusto Pinochet\n- Places: Chile\n- Roles: dictator, Commander-in-Chief, general, politician\n\nFacts:\n- The Popular Unitary Action Movement, also known as MAPU, was a small leftist political party in Chile.\n- The Popular Unitary Action Movement was part of the Popular Unity coalition during the government of Salvador Allende.\n- Augusto Pinochet was born on 25 November 1915 and died on 10 December 2006.\n- Augusto Pinochet was a Chilean general, politician, and dictator of Chile from 1973 to 1990.\n- Augusto Pinochet remained Commander-in-Chief of the Chilean Army until 1998.",
